OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's return to UK
OL,4,Areignites questions over security
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex's
OL,7,Fsurprise announcement that they will
OL,8,Freturn to the UK this month has
OL,9,Freignited questions over the level of
OL,10,Ftheir publicly funded security in
OL,11,FBritain.
OL,13,FPrince Harry and Meghan plan to
OL,14,Frelocate from the US to a private,
OL,15,Fnon-royal residence outside London,
OL,16,Fwith their children, Prince Archie,
OL,17,Fseven, and Princess Lilibet, five,
OL,18,Fenrolled to start at school in
OL,19,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11905
SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787264728
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws            G5/41
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's return to UK
OL,4,Areignites questions over security
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir UK security was downgraded after
OL,7,Fthey stopped being working royals in
OL,8,F2020 and moved to the US, where they
OL,9,Fhave paid for their own protection.
OL,11,FThe Royal and VIP Executive Committee
OL,12,F(Ravec), an independent body overseen
OL,13,Fby the Home Office, will now have to
OL,14,Fmake a new decision as previous
OL,15,Farrangements were based on the Sussexes
OL,16,Fnot living in the UK permanently.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
