OL,3,ARussia 'purposefully' hit critical
OL,4,Ainfrastructure in latest strikes, Kyiv
OL,5,Amayor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia's latest attack on Kyiv marks
OL,8,Fthe first time in several months
OL,9,Fcritical infrastructure "was
OL,10,Fpurposefully attacked" in the Ukrainian
OL,11,Fcapital, the city's mayor said.
OL,13,FAt least 17 people have been killed as
OL,14,Fblocks of flats and warehouses were
OL,15,Fstruck across the city overnight, the
OL,16,FState Emergency Service of Ukraine
OL,17,Fsaid. A children's hospital and school
OL,18,Fwere also damaged, and more than 40
OL,19,Fpeople have been injured, it added.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
