OL,3,ADozens dead after boat capsizes in
OL,4,Anorth-western Nigeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 46 people have died in Nigeria
OL,7,Fafter a boat capsized in north-western
OL,8,FSokoto state.
OL,10,FThe boat was believed to be carrying
OL,11,Fmore than 70 people, mostly children,
OL,12,Fand a search operation is ongoing,
OL,13,Fofficials say.
OL,15,FPolice spokesperson Ahmad Rufai told
OL,16,Fthe BBC on Thursday that 46 bodies had
OL,17,Fbeen found near Gorau in Gorony.
OL,18,FSixteen people have been recovered
OL,19,Fsafely, while 15 are still missing.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
