OL,3,ADozens dead after boat capsizes in
OL,4,Anorth-western Nigeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe area is difficult to reach, and
OL,7,Fsecurity agencies and emergency
OL,8,Fservices are heading to the site, Rufai
OL,9,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
