OL,3,AComo mayor hit by electric bike and
OL,4,Aissues blanket ban in Italian city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of Como has banned riding
OL,7,Fbicycles in certain areas of the
OL,8,Fhistoric Italian city after he was hit
OL,9,Fby an electric one.
OL,11,FAlessandro Rapinese said the ban was
OL,12,Fnecessary to improve public safety. It
OL,13,Fmeans from September, cyclists will
OL,14,Fhave to dismount through an area of
OL,15,Faround 30 streets.
OL,17,FHe told Italian news agency Ansa:
OL,18,F"People act based on their own
OL,19,Fexperiences and I know what it's like
OL,20,Fto be hit by one of these beasts."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
